abstract: >-
  A free, offline-first coding and AI curriculum and web app with nine levels,
  from KG1 to frontier-AI research and the future of AI. It is built around African
  problems and resources, frugal engineering, and an enterprise and wealth path,
  so learners can use, reproduce, innovate and produce technology from what they have at hand.
